stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Starting
  Starting --> Initializing: load configuration and state
  Initializing --> Listening: HTTPS/WSS and discovery ready
  Listening --> Connected: authenticated client connects
  Connected --> Listening: client disconnects
  Listening --> Recovering: service or dependency failure
  Connected --> Recovering: host session interruption
  Recovering --> Initializing: retry initialization
  Listening --> Stopping: user or service stop
  Connected --> Stopping: shutdown
  Stopping --> [*]
